  "ReviewNotes": [
    "The typed five-point four-massive-Dirac plus color-singlet-scalar domain with a balanced nonempty fundamental pair excludes all251 known cases and36 prior colored chiral cases. Exactly45 pending cases are eligible. No process name or saved answer selects the source.",
    "Every used minimal Lorentz vertex is matched symbolically. Ordered ports, poles, actual fermion signs, resolved helicity blocks, exact color coordinates and Gram reconstruction are retained per graph. Color is restored before the coherent full sum. No independent square sum, numerical coefficient fit, internal-shell assumption or new independent contact is used.",
